      <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1534528741775-53994a69daeb?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=500" alt="Foto Profil" class="relative w-64 h-64 md:w-80 md:h-80 object-cover rounded-2xl shadow-2xl border border-slate-700/50" />
