        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-indigo-500/10 flex items-center justify-center text-indigo-400 mb-4 group-hover:bg-indigo-600 group-hover:text-white transition-colors">
          <i data-lucide="code-2" class="w-6 h-6"></i>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-2">Frontend Development</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">Membangun antarmuka pengguna yang interaktif, cepat, dan ramah aksesibilitas.</p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-xs font-medium bg-slate-700/60 text-slate-300">HTML / CSS</span>
          <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-xs font-medium bg-slate-700/60 text-slate-300">Tailwind CSS</span>
          <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-xs font-medium bg-slate-700/60 text-slate-300">JavaScript</span>
          <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-xs font-medium bg-slate-700/60 text-slate-300">React.js</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2 -->
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-800/50 border border-slate-700/60 hover:border-indigo-500/50 transition-all group">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-cyan-500/10 flex items-center justify-center text-cyan-400 mb-4 group-hover:bg-cyan-600 group-hover:text-white transition-colors">
          <i data-lucide="server" class="w-6 h-6"></i>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-2">Backend Development</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">Merancang arsitektur server, API RESTful, dan integrasi basis data yang tangguh.</p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-xs font-medium bg-slate-700/60 text-slate-300">Node.js</span>
          <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-xs font-medium bg-slate-700/60 text-slate-300">Express</span>
          <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-xs font-medium bg-slate-700/60 text-slate-300">PostgreSQL</span>
          <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-xs font-medium bg-slate-700/60 text-slate-300">Prisma</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 3 -->
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-800/50 border border-slate-700/60 hover:border-indigo-500/50 transition-all group">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-emerald-500/10 flex items-center justify-center text-emerald-400 mb-4 group-hover:bg-emerald-600 group-hover:text-white transition-colors">
          <i data-lucide="wrench" class="w-6 h-6"></i>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-2">Tools & Workflow</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">Mengoptimalkan alur kerja pengembangan aplikasi dengan praktik DevOps dasar.</p>
