          <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-xs font-medium bg-slate-700/60 text-slate-300">Figma</span>
          <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-xs font-medium bg-slate-700/60 text-slate-300">Vercel</span>
        </div>
      </div>
