            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Analytics Dashboard Pro</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm mb-4 leading-relaxed">Platform analisis data bisnis secara real-time yang memvisualisasikan matriks penjualan dan perilaku pengguna.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between pt-4 border-t border-slate-700/40">
            <div class="flex gap-2 text-xs text-slate-400">
