          <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1472851294608-062f824d29cc?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=800" alt="Aplikasi E-Commerce" class="w-full h-52 object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition duration-500" />
